{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるホテルにて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/20/8525948/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日勉強になることばっかり毎日\n学校は体育祭に向けて\n準備中です。っはっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習で膝擦りむいた。\nそんなにぐちゅぐちゅなって\nないからよかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/20/8525948/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キズパワーパッドで治りました。\nキズパワーパッドすげえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の夕飯は\n家族そろって豆乳鍋でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ暑いけど\nもう鍋とかあったかいものを\n食べたい気分なのよ。\n冷え性にはあったかいのが\nいちばんなのよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷え性辛いのよね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほくほく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん、始球式\nお疲れさまでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/20/8525948/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始球式には行けなかったけど、\nニュース見た！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、最寄り駅のコンビニ行ったら\nラルムが置いてあって\n表紙に美女がいて\nふぁ！！！ってなった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわええーって！\nまいやん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ケラ！表紙の生駒ちゃん\nめっちゃかわいかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私的にいちばん最後のページの\n服装がすきでした。\nふわっふわしててすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車とかでも見かけるようになって\nなんか、自分が不思議な感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\n秋イベントが続々と\n決まってる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだなー♪\n出れたらいいなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はビックサイトで握手"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/20/8525948/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部2部3部よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/09/20/8525948/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅの浴衣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／\nおやすみ！みんなおやすみ！\n＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}